2.
Definitions .-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Wild Life (Protection) Act, 1972 (
53 of 1972
);
(b)
"Chairperson" means the Chairperson of the Tiger Conservation Authority;
(c)
"Fund" means the Tiger Conservation Authority Fund constituted under sub-section (2) of section 38-Q;
(d)
"member" means a member of the Tiger Conservation Authority;
(e)
"Member-Secretary" means the Member-Secretary of the Tiger Conservation Authority;
(f)
"section" means section of the Act;
(g)
"Tiger Conservation Authority" means the National Tiger Conservation Authority constituted under section 38-L;
(h)
"Vice-Chairperson" means the Vice-Chairperson of the Tiger Conservation Authority.
